Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ros-rolling-diagnostic-msgs, ros-rolling-rclcpp, ros-rolling-rosgraph-monitor-msgs, ros-rolling-statistics-msgs, ros-rolling-ros-workspace
Description: Near-zero-overhead ROS 2 probe for per-topic message frequency and active-node liveness, covering both inter-process and intra-process traffic.
 Works on stock ROS 2 binaries via an LD_PRELOAD shim over the tracetools instrumentation layer: no patched rmw_implementation, no ROS recompile, no privileges, and no DDS traffic.
